{"created": "2026-09-12T21:09:39.875074+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-12T21:09:40.177699+00:00", "id": 22723520, "conceptrecid": "22723519", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22723519", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "metadata": {"title": "A non-concise formula in the integer Heisenberg group", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "publication_date": "2026-09-12", "description": "<p>A first-order formula in the language of groups is concise in a class of groups if, in every group in that class, finiteness of its solution set implies finiteness of the subgroup generated by that set. We give a parameter-free positive formula with one free variable that is not concise in the class of residually finite groups, answering Problem 21.106 of the Kourovka Notebook negatively. The counterexample is the integer Heisenberg group: the formula defines exactly the two generators of its infinite cyclic centre. More generally, over any commutative ring with identity, the same formula defines the central elements whose third coordinate is a unit. The proof uses a determinant identity and explicit witnesses for the quantifiers. Reduction of coordinates modulo positive integers establishes residual finiteness. The example is generated by two elements, torsion-free, and nilpotent of class two. The formula and the stated group-theoretic results have been formalized in Lean 4 using Mathlib.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jayadevan, Achyuth", "affiliation": "Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE", "orcid": "0009-0008-8745-4078"}], "keywords": ["Kourovka Problem 21.106", "Conciseness", "First-order formulae", "Heisenberg group", "Residual finiteness", "Lean 4"], "version": "1.0.0", "references": ["L. Ciobanu and M. Conte, Concise formulae in groups of non-positive curvature, preprint, 2026. https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.06023", "M. Conte and J. M. Petschick, Conciseness of first-order formulae, Monatsh. Math. 209 (2026), 215\u2013240. https://doi.org/10.1007/s00605-025-02127-5", "L. de Moura and S. Ullrich, The Lean 4 theorem prover and programming language, in Automated Deduction\u2014CADE 28, Lecture Notes in Computer Science 12699, Springer, 2021, pp. 625\u2013635. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-79876-5_37", "E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), Unsolved Problems in Group Theory: The Kourovka Notebook, 21st ed., 2026, Problem 21.106, p. 183. https://arxiv.org/abs/1401.0300v46", "The mathlib Community, The Lean mathematical library, in Proceedings of the 9th ACM SIGPLAN International Conference on Certified Programs and Proofs, ACM, 2020, pp. 367\u2013381. https://doi.org/10.1145/3372885.3373824"], "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Achxy/k-21-106", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "lean", "title": {"en": "Lean"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22723519"}}]}}, "title": "A non-concise formula in the integer Heisenberg group", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22723520", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22723520?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22723520", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723519", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22723519", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22723519", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22723519", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22723520:kourovka-21-106-paper.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22723520/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22723520/quota-increase", "request